   "fieldname": "playback_section",
   "fieldtype": "Section Break",
   "label": "Patrol Playback",
   "description": "Playback follows the Patrol Map's own rules: with Hide Patrol Points Outside Farm Boundary on, a farm shows every position inside its boundary (grown by Boundary Tolerance) whatever farm it was saved under, and a trail is split where the guard leaves the farm. GPS fixes worse than 100 m are dropped, as on the map."
