   "fieldtype": "Section Break",
   "label": "Patrol Checkpoints",
   "description": "A scan counts when the phone is within the checkpoint's Fence Radius plus its own reported GPS accuracy, up to the allowance below. Positions are set on site from the app by a System Manager or Security Head."
  },
  {
   "default": "7",
   "description": "How much of the phone's reported GPS accuracy may be added to a checkpoint's Fence Radius. Keeps a vague fix from stretching the fence.",
